B.aD9=s(["Meet for iced coffee at a cozy corner caf\xe9 \u2014 keep the first chat light and warm.","Grab matcha lattes and take a slow walk through a pretty downtown street.","Share a fruit smoothie at a sunny outdoor patio and people-watch together.","Try a dessert caf\xe9 \u2014 split a slice of cake and talk about favorite memories.","Meet for hot chocolate on a cool evening; bring a light jacket for them if it is chilly.","Visit a bookstore caf\xe9, pick a book each, and swap why you chose it.","Get bubble tea with two straws and play \u201cthis or that\u201d questions.","Meet at a farmers market, sample something small, and stroll the stalls.","Share artisan pizza at a small Italian spot \u2014 split a margherita and a salad.","Try tacos from a popular local truck, then sit in a park nearby.","Breakfast date: pancakes, fresh juice, and no rush to leave the table.","Sushi lunch at a calm spot \u2014 order a few rolls to share and one surprise roll.","Meet for fresh lemonade and sandwiches at a riverside bench.","Visit a tea house for jasmine tea and quiet conversation.","Grab gelato and walk through a garden or campus green.","Try a food hall: each pick one dish and taste from both plates.","Meet for soup and bread at a homestyle diner \u2014 comfort food builds comfort.","Share a charcuterie board and sparkling water at a wine-free bistro patio.","Visit a donut shop early and bring one extra for \u201clater.\u201d","Meet for acai bowls and talk about dreams, not just schedules.","Try a juice bar smoothie bowl after a short morning hike together.","Meet at a rooftop caf\xe9 at golden hour \u2014 photos optional, presence required.","Share pasta at a candle-free lunch spot; save candles for another time.","Visit a bakery, choose two pastries, and rank them honestly.","Meet for chai and samosas at a cozy Indian caf\xe9.","Try Korean street snacks at a small shop and share everything.","Meet for fresh spring rolls and iced tea \u2014 light, fresh, easy to talk.","Share fish and chips by the water if you live near a coast or lake.","Visit a plant-based caf\xe9 even if you are not vegan \u2014 curiosity is attractive.","Meet for espresso and cannoli \u2014 short, sweet, memorable.","Try a build-your-own bowl place; compare creations like a fun contest.","Meet at a dog-friendly patio if one of you has a calm pet \u2014 instant icebreaker.","Share crepes \u2014 one savory, one sweet \u2014 at a French-style caf\xe9.","Visit a chocolate shop for truffles and a five-minute tasting ritual.","Meet for pho or ramen; warm bowls make honest conversation easier.","Try a Mediterranean platter with hummus, pita, and grilled vegetables.","Meet for iced hibiscus tea and a shared salad on a shaded terrace.","Visit a comic shop with a caf\xe9 inside \u2014 laugh together early.","Share wings or sliders at a sports bar during an early, quiet hour.","Meet for cronuts or fresh croissants and talk about childhood favorites.","Try a pop-up food event \u2014 exploring something new together bonds fast.","Meet for coconut water and tropical fruit after a beach walk.","Share a cheese toastie and tomato soup on a rainy afternoon.","Visit a flower market and buy one stem each for the other.","Meet for lavender latte and shortbread at a calm neighborhood spot.","Try handmade pasta at a chef-owned trattoria \u2014 dress cute but casual.","Meet for boba and board games at a caf\xe9 that hosts game nights.","Share a picnic basket you prepared: sandwiches, grapes, and a kind note.","Visit a sunset viewpoint with thermoses of cider or sparkling juice.","End the first meet with a clear \u201cI enjoyed today\u201d \u2014 confidence is romantic."],t.s)
